        "content": "## 📋 Checklist Dispatch\nFour pre-written document checklists — property, family, criminal, and a fallback. Each branch sets the appropriate text so the downstream Telegram node can send it without any conditional logic."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "609868a2-0c1c-4cae-afc7-e5030a9d0790",
      "name": "Section – Logging, Calendar & Notifications",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
