        "content": "## ⚠️ Error Handling\nTwo error paths: the workflow-level error trigger catches any node failure globally; the AI node's error output catches classification failures specifically. Both route to Slack. Update the alert message to include context before going live."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
